#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/PreviewHeader.tpl
msgid "Test-drive Your Contribution Page"
msgstr "Preizkusite svojo stran za prispevke"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/PreviewHeader.tpl
msgid ""
"This page is currently running in <strong>test-drive mode</strong>. "
"Transactions will be sent to your payment processor's test server. "
"<strong>No live financial transactions will be submitted. However, a contact"
" record will be created or updated and a test contribution record will be "
"saved to the database. Use obvious test contact names so you can review and "
"delete these records as needed. Test contributions are not visible on the "
"Contributions tab, but can be viewed by searching for 'Test Contributions' "
"in the CiviContribute search form.</strong> Refer to your payment "
"processor's documentation for information on values to use for test credit "
"card number, security code, postal code, etc."
msgstr "Ta stran trenutno deluje v <strong>preizkusnem načinu</strong>. Transakcije bodo poslane preizkusnemu strežniku ponudnika plačilnih storitev. <strong>Dejanske finančne transakcije ne bodo poslane. Kljub temu bo zapis stika ustvarjen ali posodobljen, preizkusni zapis prispevka pa bo shranjen v zbirko podatkov. Uporabljajte prepoznavna imena preizkusnih stikov, da boste zapise lahko pregledali in po potrebi izbrisali. Preizkusni prispevki niso vidni na zavihku Prispevki, lahko pa jih poiščete z možnostjo »Preizkusni prispevki« v iskalnem obrazcu CiviContribute.</strong> Podatke za preizkusno številko kreditne kartice, varnostno kodo, poštno številko in podobno poiščite v dokumentaciji ponudnika plačilnih storitev."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/PreviewHeader.tpl
msgid "Test payment processor on Your Contribution Page"
msgstr "Preizkusni ponudnik plačilnih storitev na vaši strani za prispevke"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/PreviewHeader.tpl
msgid ""
"This page is currently configured to use the <strong>%1 payment "
"processor</strong>. <strong>No live financial transactions will be submitted"
" if %1 payment processor is selected. However, a contact record will be "
"created or updated and a live contribution record will be saved to the "
"database with no actual financial transaction. Remove %1 payment processor "
"before going live.</strong>"
msgstr "Ta stran je trenutno nastavljena za uporabo <strong>ponudnika plačilnih storitev %1</strong>. <strong>Če je izbran ponudnik %1, dejanske finančne transakcije ne bodo poslane. Kljub temu bo zapis stika ustvarjen ali posodobljen, v zbirko podatkov pa bo shranjen dejanski zapis prispevka brez finančne transakcije. Pred objavo odstranite ponudnika %1.</strong>"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"An email confirmation with these payment instructions has been sent to %1 "
"and to %2."
msgstr "Potrditev s temi navodili za plačilo je bila po e-pošti poslana na %1 in %2."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"An email confirmation with these payment instructions has been sent to %1."
msgstr "Potrditev s temi navodili za plačilo je bila po e-pošti poslana na %1."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid "Your contribution has been submitted to %1 for processing."
msgstr "Vaš prispevek je poslan ponudniku %1 v obdelavo."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"An email receipt will be sent to %1 and to %2 once the transaction is "
"processed successfully."
msgstr "Ko bo transakcija uspešno obdelana, bo potrdilo po e-pošti poslano na %1 in %2."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"An email receipt will be sent to %1 once the transaction is processed "
"successfully."
msgstr "Ko bo transakcija uspešno obdelana, bo potrdilo po e-pošti poslano na %1."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid "Your transaction has been processed successfully."
msgstr "Vaša transakcija je uspešno obdelana."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid "An email receipt has also been sent to %1 and to %2"
msgstr "Potrdilo je bilo po e-pošti poslano tudi na %1 in %2"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid "An email receipt has also been sent to %1"
msgstr "Potrdilo je bilo po e-pošti poslano tudi na %1"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid "Membership Transaction #"
msgstr "Transakcija članstva št."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"You will receive an email receipt which includes information about how to "
"cancel the auto-renewal option."
msgstr "Prejeli boste potrdilo po e-pošti z navodili za preklic samodejnega podaljšanja."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"You will receive an email receipt which includes information about how to "
"update or cancel this recurring contribution."
msgstr "Prejeli boste potrdilo po e-pošti z navodili za posodobitev ali preklic tega ponavljajočega se prispevka."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"We will record your initial pledge payment when we receive it from you. You "
"will be able to modify or cancel future pledge payments at any time by "
"logging in to your account or contacting us at %1."
msgstr "Začetno plačilo zaveze bomo zabeležili, ko ga prejmemo. Prihodnja plačila zaveze lahko kadar koli spremenite ali prekličete tako, da se prijavite v svoj račun ali stopite v stik z nami na %1."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"Your initial pledge payment has been processed. You will be able to modify "
"or cancel future pledge payments at any time by contacting us at %1."
msgstr "Začetno plačilo zaveze je obdelano. Prihodnja plačila zaveze boste lahko kadar koli spremenili ali preklicali tako, da stopite v stik z nami na %1."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"We will send you a payment reminder %1 days prior to each scheduled payment "
"date. The reminder will include a link to a page where you can make your "
"payment online."
msgstr "Opomnik za plačilo vam bomo poslali %1 dni pred vsakim načrtovanim datumom plačila. Vseboval bo povezavo do strani, na kateri lahko plačilo opravite prek spleta."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "Use this form to edit a contribution on behalf of %1."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem uredite prispevek v imenu stika %1."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "Use this form to submit a new contribution on behalf of %1."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem vnesite nov prispevek v imenu stika %1."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "Use this form to submit a new contribution."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem vnesite nov prispevek."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid ""
"You will not be able to send an automatic email receipt for this "
"contribution because there is no email address recorded for this contact. If"
" you want a receipt to be sent when this contribution is recorded, click "
"Cancel and then click Edit from the Summary tab to add an email address "
"before recording the contribution."
msgstr "Samodejnega potrdila za ta prispevek ne bo mogoče poslati po e-pošti, ker za ta stik ni navedenega e-poštnega naslova. Če želite ob beleženju prispevka poslati potrdilo, kliknite Prekliči, nato na zavihku Povzetek kliknite Uredi in pred beleženjem prispevka dodajte e-poštni naslov."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: Deleting this contribution will result in the loss of the "
"associated financial transactions (if any)."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Z izbrisom tega prispevka bodo izgubljene tudi povezane finančne transakcije, če obstajajo."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "submit credit card contribution"
msgstr "pošlji prispevek s kreditno kartico"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid ""
"You can leave the number of installments blank if you want to make an open-"
"ended commitment. In either case, you can choose to cancel at any time."
msgstr "Če želite skleniti časovno neomejeno zavezo, lahko število obrokov pustite prazno. V obeh primerih jo lahko kadar koli prekličete."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid ""
"You can set a start date for recurring contributions and the first payment "
"will be on that date. For a single post-dated contribution you must select "
"recurring and choose one installment"
msgstr "Za ponavljajoče se prispevke lahko določite začetni datum; prvo plačilo bo izvedeno na ta datum. Za enkratni prispevek z datumom v prihodnosti izberite ponavljanje in en obrok"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "Cancellation or Refund Information"
msgstr "Podatki o preklicu ali vračilu"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter the cancellation or refunded date, or you can skip this field and the "
"cancellation date or refunded date will be automatically set to TODAY."
msgstr "Vnesite datum preklica ali vračila. Polje lahko tudi izpustite in datum preklica oziroma vračila bo samodejno nastavljen na DANES."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "Automatically email a receipt for this payment to %1?"
msgstr "Samodejno pošljem potrdilo za to plačilo stiku %1 po e-pošti?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "Automatically email a receipt for this payment to "
msgstr "Samodejno pošlji potrdilo za to plačilo po e-pošti na "

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid ""
"Search for the Personal Campaign Page by the fund-raiser's last name or "
"email address."
msgstr "Osebno stran kampanje poiščite po priimku ali e-poštnem naslovu zbiratelja sredstev."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid ""
"Click OK to save this contribution record AND send a receipt to the "
"contributor now"
msgstr "Kliknite V redu, da shranite zapis prispevka IN takoj pošljete potrdilo plačniku"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "Manual contribution amount"
msgstr "Ročno vneseni znesek prispevka"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Contribution.tpl
msgid "Amount with %1 :"
msgstr "Znesek z %1:"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionCharts.tpl
msgid "There were no contributions during the selected year."
msgstr "V izbranem letu ni bilo prispevkov."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionCharts.tpl
msgid "There are no live contribution records to display."
msgstr "Ni dejanskih zapisov prispevkov za prikaz."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.hlp
msgid ""
"Select a Financial Type that has both a 'Cost of Sales Premiums Account' and"
" a 'Premiums Inventory Account' if you want to generate accounting "
"transactions to track the cost of premiums used."
msgstr "Če želite ustvarjati računovodske transakcije za spremljanje stroškov uporabljenih nagrad, izberite finančno vrsto, ki ima račun »Stroški prodanih nagrad« in račun »Zaloga nagrad«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.hlp
msgid ""
"The default Financial Type is configured when creating the \"Premium\" but "
"it can be changed for each contribution page if required."
msgstr "Privzeta finančna vrsta se nastavi ob ustvarjanju nagrade, po potrebi pa jo lahko spremenite za vsako stran za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
msgid "Add Products to This Page"
msgstr "Dodaj izdelke na to stran"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
msgid "Remove Products from this Page"
msgstr "Odstrani izdelke s te strani"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
msgid ""
"This is a preview of this product as it will appear on your Contributions "
"page(s)."
msgstr "To je predogled izdelka, kot bo prikazan na straneh za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to select a premium to be offered on this Online Contribution "
"Page."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem izberite nagrado za ponudbo na spletni strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove this premium product from this Contribution "
"page?"
msgstr "Ali res želite odstraniti ta izdelek za nagrado s strani za prispevke?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
msgid ""
"Pick a premium to include on this Contribution Page. Use <a href='%1'>Manage"
" Premiums</a> to create or enable additional premium choices for your site."
msgstr "Izberite nagrado, ki jo želite vključiti na to stran za prispevke. Dodatne nagrade ustvarite ali omogočite na strani <a href='%1'>Upravljanje nagrad</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"There are no financial types configured with linked 'Cost of Sales Premiums'"
" and 'Premiums Inventory Account' accounts. If you want to generate "
"accounting transactions which track the cost of premiums used <a "
"href='%1'>click here</a> to configure financial types and accounts."
msgstr "Nobena finančna vrsta nima povezanih računov »Stroški prodanih nagrad« in »Zaloga nagrad«. Če želite ustvarjati računovodske transakcije za spremljanje stroškov uporabljenih nagrad, <a href='%1'>kliknite tukaj</a> in nastavite finančne vrste ter račune."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
msgid "Reset to default for selected product"
msgstr "Ponastavi na privzeto vrednost izbranega izdelka"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/AddProduct.tpl
msgid ""
"Weight controls the order that premiums are displayed on the Contribution "
"Page."
msgstr "Teža določa vrstni red prikaza nagrad na strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.hlp
msgid ""
"Uncheck this box if you are using this contribution page for free membership"
" signup ONLY, or to solicit in-kind / non-monetary donations such as "
"furniture, equipment.. etc."
msgstr "To polje počistite, če stran za prispevke uporabljate SAMO za brezplačno včlanitev ali za zbiranje stvarnih oziroma nedenarnih donacij, kot so pohištvo, oprema in podobno."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.hlp
msgid ""
"Instructions added to Confirmation and Thank-you pages, as well as the "
"confirmation email, when the user selects the 'pay later' option (e.g. 'Mail"
" your check to ... within 3 business days.')."
msgstr "Navodila, ki se dodajo na potrditveno stran, stran z zahvalo in v potrditveno e-pošto, ko uporabnik izbere možnost »plačaj pozneje« (npr. »Ček pošljite na ... v treh delovnih dneh.«)."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.hlp
msgid ""
"Uncheck this box if you are using this contribution page for membership "
"signup and renewal only &ndash; and you do NOT want users to select or enter"
" any additional contribution amounts."
msgstr "To polje počistite, če stran za prispevke uporabljate samo za včlanitev in podaljšanje članstva ter NE želite, da uporabniki izberejo ali vnesejo dodaten znesek prispevka."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to give users the option to make recurring "
"contributions. This feature requires that you use a payment processor which "
"supports recurring billing / subscriptions functionality."
msgstr "To polje označite, če želite uporabnikom omogočiti ponavljajoče se prispevke. Ta možnost zahteva ponudnika plačilnih storitev, ki podpira ponavljajoče se obračunavanje oziroma naročnine."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to give users the option to make a Pledge (a "
"commitment to contribute a fixed amount on a recurring basis)."
msgstr "To polje označite, če želite uporabnikom omogočiti zavezo, torej obljubo ponavljajočega se prispevanja fiksnega zneska."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to give users the option to enter their own "
"contribution amount. Your page will then include a text field labeled "
"<strong>Other Amount</strong>."
msgstr "To polje označite, če želite uporabnikom omogočiti vnos lastnega zneska prispevka. Stran bo nato vsebovala besedilno polje <strong>Drugi znesek</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also set minimum and maximum amounts that users are allowed to "
"enter."
msgstr "Določite lahko tudi najnižji in najvišji znesek, ki ga smejo vnesti."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this form to configure Contribution Amount options. You can give "
"contributors the ability to enter their own contribution amounts and/or "
"provide a fixed list of amounts. For fixed amounts, you can enter a label "
"for each 'level' of contribution (e.g. Friend, Sustainer, etc.). If you "
"allow people to enter their own dollar amounts, you can also set minimum and"
" maximum values. Depending on your choice of Payment Processor, you may be "
"able to offer a recurring contribution option."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem nastavite možnosti zneskov prispevkov. Plačnikom lahko omogočite vnos lastnega zneska in/ali ponudite seznam fiksnih zneskov. Za vsako raven fiksnega prispevka lahko vnesete oznako (npr. prijatelj, podpornik). Če omogočite vnos lastnega zneska, lahko določite tudi najnižjo in najvišjo vrednost. Glede na izbranega ponudnika plačilnih storitev lahko ponudite tudi ponavljajoče se prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid ""
"No Payment Processor has been configured / enabled for your site. Unless you"
" are only using CiviContribute to solicit non-monetary / in-kind "
"contributions, you will need to <a href='%1'>configure a Payment "
"Processor</a>. Then return to this screen and assign the processor to this "
"Contribution Page."
msgstr "Za spletno mesto ni nastavljen oziroma omogočen noben ponudnik plačilnih storitev. Če CiviContribute ne uporabljate samo za nedenarne oziroma stvarne prispevke, morate <a href='%1'>nastaviti ponudnika plačilnih storitev</a>. Nato se vrnite na ta zaslon in ga dodelite tej strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid ""
"Select a Price Set to offer more complex amount options. Otherwise, leave "
"this empty and enter fixed contribution options below."
msgstr "Za zahtevnejše možnosti zneskov izberite cenik. Sicer pustite polje prazno in spodaj vnesite možnosti fiksnih prispevkov."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid "Can users also set an interval (e.g. every '3' months)?"
msgstr "Ali lahko uporabniki določijo tudi interval (npr. vsake »3« mesece)?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid ""
"Give the user a choice of installments (e.g. donate every month for 6 "
"months)? If not, recurring donations will continue indefinitely."
msgstr "Ali naj uporabnik izbere število obrokov (npr. prispeva vsak mesec šest mesecev)? Če ne, se bodo ponavljajoči se prispevki nadaljevali brez omejitve."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid "Can they also set an interval (e.g. every '3' months)?"
msgstr "Ali lahko določijo tudi interval (npr. vsake »3« mesece)?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid "Fixed Contribution Options"
msgstr "Možnosti fiksnih prispevkov"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid ""
"Use the table below to enter up to ten fixed contribution amounts. These "
"will be presented as a list of radio button options. Both the label and "
"dollar amount will be displayed."
msgstr "V spodnjo tabelo vnesite največ deset fiksnih zneskov prispevkov. Prikazani bodo kot seznam izbirnih gumbov z oznako in denarnim zneskom."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid ""
" Click <a id='quickconfig' href='#'>here</a> if you want to configure the "
"Fixed Contribution Options below as part of a Price Set, with the added "
"flexibility and complexity that entails."
msgstr " Če želite spodnje možnosti fiksnih prispevkov nastaviti kot del cenika, kar omogoča več prilagodljivosti, a tudi zahtevnejšo nastavitev, kliknite <a id='quickconfig' href='#'>tukaj</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid "Contribution Label"
msgstr "Oznaka prispevka"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Amount.tpl
msgid ""
"You cannot enable the Contribution Amounts section when a Membership Price "
"Set is in use. (See the Memberships tab above.) Membership Price Sets may "
"include additional fields for non-membership options that require an "
"additional fee (e.g. magazine subscription) or an additional voluntary "
"contribution."
msgstr "Razdelka Zneski prispevkov ni mogoče omogočiti, ko je v uporabi cenik članstev (glejte zgornji zavihek Članstva). Ceniki članstev lahko vsebujejo dodatna polja za možnosti, ki niso povezane s članstvom in zahtevajo dodatno plačilo (npr. naročnina na revijo) ali dodaten prostovoljni prispevek."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want collect additional information from contributors, you can "
"include one or two CiviCRM Profiles&mdash;which are collections of standard "
"or custom fields&mdash;in this contribution page. For example, you may need "
"to collect information about the person (e.g. name and address if these are "
"not already required by your payment processor, interest in subscribing to a"
" newsletter or volunteering). You might also want to collect information "
"specific to this contribution (e.g. target one or several projects or funds "
"to support with this contribution)."
msgstr "Če želite od plačnikov zbrati dodatne podatke, lahko na stran za prispevke vključite enega ali dva profila CiviCRM, ki vsebujeta standardna polja ali polja po meri. Zbirate lahko na primer podatke o osebi (ime in naslov, če ju ne zahteva že ponudnik plačilnih storitev, zanimanje za novice ali prostovoljstvo) ter podatke, značilne za prispevek (npr. projekte ali sklade, ki naj jih prispevek podpre)."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.hlp
msgid ""
"Your site may already have profile(s) which were previously created for this"
" purpose, in which case you can re-use them for any number of online "
"contribution pages."
msgstr "Na spletnem mestu morda že obstajajo profili, ustvarjeni v ta namen. Ponovno jih lahko uporabite na poljubnem številu spletnih strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.hlp
msgid ""
"If you haven't already configured custom fields and a profile to collect "
"data you need for this form, you can create them here using the steps below."
msgstr "Če polj po meri in profila za zbiranje podatkov, potrebnih na tem obrazcu, še niste nastavili, jih lahko ustvarite po spodnjih korakih."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.hlp
msgid ""
"Create a new profile by clicking the 'Create' button next to the 'Include "
"Profile' field. Name your new profile (e.g. 'Contribution Information')."
msgstr "Nov profil ustvarite s klikom gumba »Ustvari« ob polju »Vključi profil«. Profil poimenujte, na primer »Podatki o prispevku«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.hlp
msgid ""
"Add any existing fields needed by dragging them into the profile form "
"builder."
msgstr "Obstoječa polja, ki jih potrebujete, povlecite v urejevalnik obrazca profila."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.hlp
msgid ""
"If you need to create new custom fields, you can also do that within the "
"profile editor. Then add the new custom field(s) to this profile by dragging"
" them into the form builder."
msgstr "Nova polja po meri lahko ustvarite tudi v urejevalniku profila. Nato jih povlecite v urejevalnik obrazca in s tem dodajte profilu."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.hlp
msgid ""
"Save your profile to return to this screen. You can preview it from here by "
"clicking the Preview button."
msgstr "Shranite profil, da se vrnete na ta zaslon. Predogled odprete z gumbom Predogled."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.hlp
msgid ""
"Profile to be included above the billing information (but after the "
"introductory message, amounts, and honoree section)."
msgstr "Profil, vključen nad podatki za obračunavanje, vendar za uvodnim sporočilom, zneski in razdelkom Počastitev."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Custom.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"You may want to collect information from contributors beyond what is "
"required to make a contribution. For example, you may want to inquire about "
"volunteer availability and skills. Add any number of fields to your "
"contribution form by selecting CiviCRM Profiles (collections of fields) to "
"include at the beginning of the page, and/or at the bottom."
msgstr "Od plačnikov boste morda želeli zbrati več podatkov, kot jih zahteva izvedba prispevka, na primer o razpoložljivosti in znanjih za prostovoljstvo. Na obrazec prispevka lahko dodate poljubno število polj tako, da izberete profile CiviCRM, ki naj se vključijo na začetku in/ali na dnu strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Delete.tpl
msgid ""
"You cannot delete this Contribution Page because it has already been used to"
" submit a contribution or membership payment. It is recommended that your "
"disable the page instead of deleting it, to preserve the integrity of your "
"contribution records. If you do want to completely delete this contribution "
"page, you first need to search for and delete all of the contribution "
"transactions associated with this page in CiviContribute."
msgstr "Te strani za prispevke ni mogoče izbrisati, ker je bila že uporabljena za oddajo prispevka ali plačilo članstva. Zaradi celovitosti zapisov prispevkov priporočamo, da stran onemogočite namesto izbrišete. Če jo želite povsem izbrisati, morate v CiviContribute najprej poiskati in izbrisati vse z njo povezane transakcije prispevkov."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Delete.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: Are you sure you want to Delete the selected Contribution Page? A "
"Delete operation cannot be undone. Do you want to continue?"
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Ali res želite izbrisati izbrano stran za prispevke? Izbrisa ni mogoče razveljaviti. Ali želite nadaljevati?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/PCP.hlp
msgid ""
"When Personal Campaign Pages are enabled, constituents will see a link "
"inviting them to create their own fundraising page after making a "
"contribution."
msgstr "Ko so osebne strani kampanje omogočene, bodo uporabniki po oddaji prispevka videli povezavo s povabilom k ustvarjanju lastne strani za zbiranje sredstev."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/PCP.hlp
msgid ""
"This is used to collect or update basic information (e.g. name and email "
"address) from users while they are creating a Personal Campaign Page. The "
"profile you select must be configured with 'Account creation required' "
"(under Profile Settings &raquo; Advanced Settings). You must include an "
"Email address field&mdash;and you may include any number of other fields in "
"the profile. If you don't yet have an appropriate Profile configured, you "
"will need to <a href='%1'>create one first</a>, and then return to this form"
" to select it."
msgstr "Ta profil se uporablja za zbiranje ali posodabljanje osnovnih podatkov uporabnikov, kot sta ime in e-poštni naslov, med ustvarjanjem osebne strani kampanje. Izbrani profil mora imeti omogočeno možnost »Ustvarjanje računa je obvezno« v razdelku Nastavitve profila &raquo; Napredne nastavitve. Vsebovati mora polje E-poštni naslov, dodate pa lahko tudi poljubna druga polja. Če ustreznega profila še nimate, ga morate <a href='%1'>najprej ustvariti</a>, nato pa se vrniti na ta obrazec in ga izbrati."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"Edit <strong>Premiums Settings</strong> to customize the title and "
"introductory message (e.g ...in appreciation of your support, you will be "
"able to select from a number of exciting thank-you gifts...). You can "
"optionally provide a contact email address and/or phone number for "
"inquiries."
msgstr "V <strong>nastavitvah nagrad</strong> prilagodite naslov in uvodno sporočilo, na primer: »V zahvalo za podporo lahko izberete eno od zanimivih daril.« Po želji navedite tudi e-poštni naslov in/ali telefonsko številko za vprašanja."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"Then select and review the premiums that you want to offer on this "
"contribution page."
msgstr "Nato izberite in preglejte nagrade, ki jih želite ponuditi na tej strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid "Premiums Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve nagrad"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid "Title to appear at the top of the Premiums section."
msgstr "Naslov, prikazan na vrhu razdelka Nagrade."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter content for the introductory message. This will be displayed below the"
" Premiums section title. You may include HTML formatting tags. You can also "
"include images, as long as they are already uploaded to a "
"server&mdash;reference them using complete URLs."
msgstr "Vnesite vsebino uvodnega sporočila, ki bo prikazano pod naslovom razdelka Nagrade. Uporabite lahko oznake HTML in slike, ki so že naložene na strežnik; nanje se sklicujte s celotnimi URL-ji."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"This email address is included in automated contribution receipts if the "
"contributor has selected a premium. It should be an appropriate contact "
"mailbox for inquiries about premium fulfillment/shipping."
msgstr "Ta e-poštni naslov je vključen v samodejna potrdila o prispevku, če je plačnik izbral nagrado. Navedite ustrezen naslov za vprašanja o pripravi in pošiljanju nagrad."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"This phone number is included in automated contribution receipts if the "
"contributor has selected a premium. It should be an appropriate phone number"
" for inquiries about premium fulfillment/shipping."
msgstr "Ta telefonska številka je vključena v samodejna potrdila o prispevku, če je plačnik izbral nagrado. Navedite ustrezno številko za vprašanja o pripravi in pošiljanju nagrad."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"Should the minimum contribution amount be automatically displayed after each"
" premium description?"
msgstr "Naj se po opisu vsake nagrade samodejno prikaže najnižji znesek prispevka?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid "You can change the text for the 'No thank-you' radio button."
msgstr "Besedilo izbirnega gumba »Brez zahvale« lahko spremenite."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"Place the 'No thank-you' radio button before OR after the list of premiums "
"offered on this page."
msgstr "Izbirni gumb »Brez zahvale« postavite pred ALI za seznam nagrad na tej strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"Select the corresponding financial type for contributions made using this "
"page (e.g. donation, capital campaign, etc.). Financial types (and "
"associated accounting codes) are included when contributions are exported, "
"so it can helpful to set up specific types for accounting purposes. You can "
"add or modify contribution available types from Administer &gt; "
"CiviContribute &gt; Financial Types."
msgstr "Izberite ustrezno finančno vrsto za prispevke prek te strani, na primer donacijo ali kapitalsko kampanjo. Finančne vrste in z njimi povezane računovodske kode se vključijo v izvoz prispevkov, zato je smiselno določiti posebne vrste za računovodske namene. Razpoložljive finančne vrste lahko dodate ali spremenite v Skrbništvo &gt; CiviContribute &gt; Finančne vrste."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"NOTE: If you are using this contribution page for membership signup and "
"renewals, the financial type configured in the membership type settings will"
" be used when recording the membership payment. The financial type selected "
"here will only be used if you are also collecting additional contributions "
"(as configured on the Membership Settings page)."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Če stran za prispevke uporabljate za včlanitev in podaljšanje članstev, se pri beleženju članarine uporabi finančna vrsta iz nastavitev vrste članstva. Tukaj izbrana finančna vrsta se uporabi samo, če zbirate tudi dodatne prispevke, kot je določeno v nastavitvah članstva."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid "Text displayed next to the checkbox on the contribution form."
msgstr "Besedilo ob potrditvenem polju na obrazcu za prispevek."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter content for the introductory message. This will be displayed below the"
" page title. You can include images, as long as they are already uploaded to"
" a server: click the \"Image\" button in the button bar."
msgstr "Vnesite vsebino uvodnega sporočila, ki bo prikazano pod naslovom strani. Vključite lahko slike, ki so že naložene na strežnik; v orodni vrstici kliknite gumb »Slika«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want content displayed at the bottom of the contribution page, enter "
"it here."
msgstr "Tukaj vnesite vsebino, ki naj bo prikazana na dnu strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter an optional goal amount for this contribution page (e.g. for this "
"'campaign'). If you enable a contribution widget for this page, the widget "
"will track progress against this goal. Otherwise, the goal will display as "
"'no limit'."
msgstr "Po želji vnesite ciljni znesek te strani za prispevke, na primer za kampanjo. Če omogočite gradnik za prispevke, bo ta prikazoval napredek proti cilju. Sicer bo cilj prikazan kot »brez omejitve«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"You can optionally set an \"active date range\" for this contribution page. "
"These dates are currently used by the \"Contribution Widget\" and \"Personal"
" Campaign Pages\". The widget will give a \"Campaign is over\" message if it"
" is accessed outside of the specified range. The \"Donate\" button will be "
"hidden on Personal Campaign Pages if accessed outside of the specified "
"range."
msgstr "Po želji lahko določite aktivno datumsko obdobje strani za prispevke. Datume uporabljata gradnik za prispevke in osebne strani kampanje. Zunaj določenega obdobja bo gradnik prikazal sporočilo »Kampanja je končana«, gumb »Prispevaj« na osebnih straneh kampanje pa bo skrit."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want to allow contributors to specify a person whom they are honoring"
" with their gift, check this box. An optional Honoree section will be "
"included in the form. Honoree information is automatically saved and linked "
"with the contribution record."
msgstr "To polje označite, če želite plačnikom omogočiti navedbo osebe, ki jo želijo počastiti s prispevkom. Obrazcu bo dodan neobvezni razdelek Počastitev. Podatki o počaščeni osebi se samodejno shranijo in povežejo z zapisom prispevka."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"Optional explanatory text for the Honoree section (displayed above the "
"Honoree fields)."
msgstr "Neobvezno pojasnjevalno besedilo razdelka Počastitev, prikazano nad polji počaščene osebe."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"If you disable this contributions will be processed immediately after "
"submitting the contribution form."
msgstr "Če to možnost onemogočite, bodo prispevki obdelani takoj po oddaji obrazca."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"When enabled, this feature allows users to identify an organization as the "
"donor or member. Logged in users will be given a choice of selecting from a "
"list of organizations that they have a permissioned relationship with OR "
"entering a new organization. Anonymous users are prompted to enter the "
"organization name. If a matching organization is found using your site's "
"configured unsupervised duplicate matching rules for Organizations, the "
"contribution or membership will be linked to that organization. Otherwise a "
"new organization contact record is created."
msgstr "Ko je možnost omogočena, lahko uporabniki kot donatorja ali člana navedejo organizacijo. Prijavljeni uporabniki lahko izberejo organizacijo, s katero imajo dovoljeno razmerje, ALI vnesejo novo. Anonimni uporabniki morajo vnesti ime organizacije. Če se po nastavljenih nenadzorovanih pravilih ujemanja dvojnikov najde ustrezna organizacija, se prispevek ali članstvo poveže z njo; sicer se ustvari nov zapis stika organizacije."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"The organization data collected from users is controlled by the Organization"
" Profile selected below. You can use the default \"On Behalf Of "
"Organization\" profile, or any other profile with type 'Contact' and/or "
"'Organization' (<a href=\"%1\">Administer > Customize Data and Screens > "
"Profiles</a>). The profile must include Organization Name and Email Address."
msgstr "Podatke o organizaciji, ki se zbirajo od uporabnikov, določa spodaj izbrani profil organizacije. Uporabite lahko privzeti profil »V imenu organizacije« ali drug profil vrste »Stik« in/ali »Organizacija« (<a href=\"%1\">Skrbništvo > Prilagodi podatke in zaslone > Profili</a>). Profil mora vsebovati ime organizacije in e-poštni naslov."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"When enabled, links helping people share this online contribution page with "
"their social network will be displayed (e.g. Facebook, Twitter, LinkedIn and"
" email)."
msgstr "Ko je možnost omogočena, se prikažejo povezave za deljenje spletne strani za prispevke v družbenih omrežjih in po e-pošti, na primer Facebook, Twitter in LinkedIn."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"Social media links will be included on the Contribution Thank-you page, "
"Tell-a-Friend page (if enabled), and in contribution receipt emails."
msgstr "Povezave za družbena omrežja bodo vključene na strani z zahvalo za prispevek, strani Povej prijatelju, če je omogočena, in v e-poštnih potrdilih."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.tpl
msgid ""
"This is the first step in creating a new online Contribution Page. You can "
"create one or more different Contribution Pages for different purposes, "
"audiences, campaigns, etc. Each page can have it's own introductory message,"
" pre-configured contribution amounts, custom data collection fields, etc."
msgstr "To je prvi korak pri ustvarjanju nove spletne strani za prispevke. Ustvarite lahko več strani za različne namene, ciljne skupine ali kampanje. Vsaka stran ima lahko svoje uvodno sporočilo, vnaprej določene zneske prispevkov in polja za zbiranje podatkov po meri."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.tpl
msgid ""
"In this step, you will configure the page title, financial type (donation, "
"campaign contribution, etc.), goal amount, and introductory message. You "
"will be able to go back and modify all aspects of this page at any time "
"after completing the setup wizard."
msgstr "V tem koraku nastavite naslov strani, finančno vrsto, kot je donacija ali prispevek kampanji, ciljni znesek in uvodno sporočilo. Po dokončanju čarovnika za nastavitev lahko kadar koli spremenite vse vidike strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this form to edit the page title, financial type (e.g. donation, "
"campaign contribution, etc.), goal amount, introduction, and status "
"(active/inactive) for this online contribution page."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem uredite naslov, finančno vrsto, ciljni znesek, uvod in stanje (aktivno/neaktivno) te spletne strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.tpl
msgid ""
"Check 'Required' to force ALL users to contribute/signup on behalf of an "
"organization."
msgstr "Označite »Obvezno«, če morajo VSI uporabniki prispevati oziroma se včlaniti v imenu organizacije."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.tpl
msgid ""
"When your page is active, you can link people to the page by copying and "
"pasting the following URL:"
msgstr "Ko je stran aktivna, lahko do nje ustvarite povezavo tako, da kopirate in prilepite naslednji URL:"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Settings.tpl
msgid ""
"When your page is active, create front-end links to the contribution page "
"using the Menu Manager. Select <strong>Administer CiviCRM &raquo; "
"CiviContribute &raquo; Manage Contribution Pages</strong> and select "
"<strong>%1</strong> for the contribution page."
msgstr "Ko je stran aktivna, ustvarite povezave do nje z upravljalnikom menijev. Izberite <strong>Skrbništvo CiviCRM &raquo; CiviContribute &raquo; Upravljanje strani za prispevke</strong> in za stran izberite <strong>%1</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this form to enable and configure a Membership Signup and Renewal "
"section for this Online Contribution Page. If you're not using this page for"
" membership signup, leave the Enabled box un-checked."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem omogočite in nastavite razdelek za včlanitev ter podaljšanje članstva na spletni strani za prispevke. Če strani ne uporabljate za včlanitev, pustite polje Omogočeno neoznačeno."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this form to configure the thank-you message and receipting options. "
"Contributors will see a confirmation and thank-you page after whenever an "
"online contribution is successfully processed. You provide the content and "
"layout of the thank-you section below. You also control whether an "
"electronic receipt is automatically emailed to each contributor, and you can"
" add a custom message to that receipt."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem nastavite zahvalno sporočilo in možnosti potrdil. Po uspešni obdelavi spletnega prispevka bodo plačniki videli potrditveno stran in stran z zahvalo. Spodaj določite vsebino in postavitev razdelka z zahvalo ter ali se vsakemu plačniku samodejno pošlje elektronsko potrdilo. Potrdilu lahko dodate tudi sporočilo po meri."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"You can use existing CiviCRM Profiles on your page or create profile(s) "
"specifically for use in Online Contribution pages. Go to <a "
"href=\"%1\"><strong>Administer CiviCRM Profiles</strong></a> if you need to "
"review, modify or create profiles (you can come back at any time to select "
"or update the Profile(s) used for this page)."
msgstr "Na strani lahko uporabite obstoječe profile CiviCRM ali ustvarite profile posebej za spletne strani za prispevke. Za pregled, urejanje ali ustvarjanje profilov odprite <a href=\"%1\"><strong>Skrbništvo profilov CiviCRM</strong></a>. Kadar koli se lahko vrnete in izberete ali posodobite profile te strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Enable the Premiums section for this Online Contribution Page, and customize"
" the title and introductory message (e.g ...in appreciation of your support,"
" you will be able to select from a number of exciting thank-you gifts...). "
"You can optionally provide a contact email address and/or phone number for "
"inquiries. Then select and review the premiums that you want to offer on "
"this contribution page."
msgstr "Omogočite razdelek Nagrade na spletni strani za prispevke ter prilagodite naslov in uvodno sporočilo, na primer: »V zahvalo za podporo lahko izberete eno od zanimivih daril.« Po želji navedite e-poštni naslov in/ali telefonsko številko za vprašanja, nato pa izberite in preglejte nagrade, ki jih želite ponuditi."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid "Widget"
msgstr "Gradnik"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Widgets allow you and your supporters to easily promote this fund-raising "
"campaign. Widget code can be added to any web page.  They will provide a "
"real-time display of current contribution results, and a direct link to this"
" contribution page."
msgstr "Gradniki vam in vašim podpornikom omogočajo preprosto promocijo kampanje za zbiranje sredstev. Kodo gradnika lahko dodate na katero koli spletno stran. Gradnik v realnem času prikazuje rezultate prispevkov in vsebuje neposredno povezavo do te strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Test-drive the entire contribution process&mdash;including custom fields, "
"confirmation, thank-you page, and receipting. Transactions will be directed "
"to your payment processor's test server. No live financial transactions will"
" be submitted. However, a contact record will be created or updated and a "
"test contribution record will be saved to the database. Use obvious test "
"contact names so you can review and delete these records as needed. Test "
"contributions are not visible on the Contributions tab, but can be viewed by"
" searching for 'Test Contributions' in the CiviContribute search form."
msgstr "Preizkusite celoten postopek prispevanja, vključno s polji po meri, potrditvijo, stranjo z zahvalo in potrdili. Transakcije bodo usmerjene na preizkusni strežnik ponudnika plačilnih storitev in dejanske finančne transakcije ne bodo poslane. Kljub temu bo zapis stika ustvarjen ali posodobljen, preizkusni prispevek pa shranjen v zbirko podatkov. Uporabljajte prepoznavna imena preizkusnih stikov, da boste zapise lahko pregledali in izbrisali. Preizkusni prispevki niso vidni na zavihku Prispevki, lahko pa jih poiščete z možnostjo »Preizkusni prispevki« v obrazcu CiviContribute."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid "Live"
msgstr "V živo"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Review your customized <strong>LIVE</strong> online contribution page here. "
"Use the following URL in links and buttons on any website to send visitors "
"to this live page:"
msgstr "Tukaj preglejte prilagojeno <strong>DEJANSKO</strong> spletno stran za prispevke. V povezavah in gumbih na katerem koli spletnem mestu uporabite naslednji URL, da obiskovalce usmerite na to stran:"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.tpl
msgid "Contribution Links"
msgstr "Povezave prispevka"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.tpl
msgid "New Contribution"
msgstr "Nov prispevek"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.tpl
msgid "Online Contribution (Test-drive)"
msgstr "Online prispevek (Testna stran)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Tab.tpl
msgid "Online Contribution (Live)"
msgstr "Online prispevek (živa stran)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this form to configure the thank-you message and receipting options for "
"this online contribution page. Contributors will see a thank-you page "
"whenever an online contribution is successfully processed. You provide the "
"content and layout of the thank-you section below. You also control whether "
"an electronic receipt is automatically emailed to each contributor, and you "
"can add a custom message to that receipt."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem nastavite zahvalno sporočilo in možnosti potrdil za spletno stran za prispevke. Po uspešni obdelavi spletnega prispevka bodo plačniki videli stran z zahvalo. Spodaj določite vsebino in postavitev razdelka z zahvalo ter ali se vsakemu plačniku samodejno pošlje elektronsko potrdilo. Potrdilu lahko dodate tudi sporočilo po meri."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"This title will be displayed at the top of the thank-you / transaction "
"confirmation page."
msgstr "Ta naslov bo prikazan na vrhu strani z zahvalo oziroma potrditvijo transakcije."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter text (and optional HTML layout) for the thank-you block that will "
"appear at the top of the Thank-you page."
msgstr "Vnesite besedilo in po želji postavitev HTML zahvalnega bloka, ki bo prikazan na vrhu strani z zahvalo."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter link(s) and/or text that you want to appear at the bottom of the "
"thank-you page. You can use this content area to encourage contributors to "
"visit a tell-a-friend page or take some other action."
msgstr "Vnesite povezave in/ali besedilo za prikaz na dnu strani z zahvalo. V tem območju lahko plačnike spodbudite k obisku strani Povej prijatelju ali k drugemu dejanju."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"NOTE: Social media links will be automatically included if you have enabled "
"'Social media sharing' for this page (see the 'Title' tab)."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Če je za stran omogočeno deljenje v družbenih omrežjih, bodo povezave samodejno vključene (glejte zavihek Naslov)."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want an electronic receipt to be sent automatically to"
" the contributor's email address."
msgstr "To polje označite, če želite elektronsko potrdilo samodejno poslati na e-poštni naslov plačnika."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"The \"Contributions - Receipt (on-line)\" System Workflow Message Template provides content and formatting for the receipt.\n"
"  You can modify it from <a href=\"%1\">Administer > Communications > Message Templates > System Workflow Messages</a>. You can also provide\n"
"  specific messaging for contributions received via this contribution page using the \"Receipt Message\" field below."
msgstr "Sistemska predloga sporočila poteka dela »Prispevki – potrdilo (spletno)« določa vsebino in oblikovanje potrdila.\n  Spremenite jo lahko v <a href=\"%1\">Skrbništvo > Komunikacije > Predloge sporočil > Sistemska sporočila poteka dela</a>.\n  Posebno sporočilo za prispevke, prejete prek te strani, lahko določite tudi v spodnjem polju »Sporočilo potrdila«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid "Enter the FROM name to be used in receipt emails."
msgstr "Vnesite ime pošiljatelja za e-poštna potrdila."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid "Enter the FROM email address to be used in receipt emails."
msgstr "Vnesite e-poštni naslov pošiljatelja za e-poštna potrdila."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter a message you want included at the beginning of emailed receipts. This"
" message will be inserted at the top of the \"Contributions - Receipt (on-"
"line)\" System Workflow Message."
msgstr "Vnesite sporočilo za začetek e-poštnih potrdil. Vstavljeno bo na vrh sistemskega sporočila poteka dela »Prispevki – potrdilo (spletno)«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: Keep in mind that this message will be included in ALL of the "
"following types of receipts related to this online contribution page"
msgstr "POMEMBNO: To sporočilo bo vključeno v VSE naslednje vrste potrdil, povezanih s to spletno stranjo za prispevke"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid "One-time online contributions"
msgstr "Enkratni spletni prispevki"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid "Recurring online contributions (if enabled for this page)"
msgstr "Ponavljajoči se spletni prispevki (če so omogočeni za to stran)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid "Automatically renewing membership payments (if enabled for this page)"
msgstr "Plačila članstev s samodejnim podaljšanjem (če so omogočena za to stran)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"NOTE: The text entered here will be used for both TEXT and HTML versions of "
"receipt emails so we do not recommend including HTML tags / formatting here."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Tukaj vneseno besedilo bo uporabljeno v besedilni in različici HTML e-poštnega potrdila, zato oznak in oblikovanja HTML ne priporočamo."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want member(s) of your organization to receive a carbon copy of each "
"emailed receipt, enter one or more email addresses here. Multiple email "
"addresses should be separated by a comma (e.g. jane@example.org, "
"paula@example.org)."
msgstr "Če želite članom organizacije poslati kopijo vsakega e-poštnega potrdila, tukaj vnesite enega ali več e-poštnih naslovov. Več naslovov ločite z vejico (npr. jane@example.org, paula@example.org)."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want member(s) of your organization to receive a BLIND carbon copy of"
" each emailed receipt, enter one or more email addresses here. Multiple "
"email addresses should be separated by a comma (e.g. jane@example.org, "
"paula@example.org)."
msgstr "Če želite članom organizacije poslati skrito kopijo vsakega e-poštnega potrdila, tukaj vnesite enega ali več e-poštnih naslovov. Več naslovov ločite z vejico (npr. jane@example.org, paula@example.org)."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to configure the thank-you message and receipting options."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem nastavite zahvalno sporočilo in možnosti potrdil."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Widget.hlp
msgid ""
"Enabling a widget for this contribution page allows you and your supporters "
"to easily promote a fund-raising campaign by embedding a chunk of dynamic "
"content in any web page. CiviContribute widgets display real-time progress "
"toward your fund-raising goals, and include a 'Contribute' button which "
"links people directly to the associated online contribution page."
msgstr "Če omogočite gradnik, lahko vi in vaši podporniki preprosto promovirate kampanjo za zbiranje sredstev tako, da dinamično vsebino vdelate v katero koli spletno stran. Gradniki CiviContribute v realnem času prikazujejo napredek proti cilju in vsebujejo gumb »Prispevaj« z neposredno povezavo do ustrezne spletne strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Widget.hlp
msgid ""
"Use the form below to configure a Widget Title (with optional logo), your "
"contribute button text, a short description of this fund-raising campaign, "
"and a link to your organizations home page (for folks who want to learn "
"more). You can also modify the default color-scheme by expanding the 'Edit "
"Widget Colors' section of the form."
msgstr "V spodnjem obrazcu nastavite naslov gradnika z neobveznim logotipom, besedilo gumba za prispevanje, kratek opis kampanje in povezavo do domače strani organizacije. Privzeto barvno shemo spremenite tako, da razširite razdelek »Uredi barve gradnika«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Widget.hlp
msgid ""
"Check the 'Enable Widget' box. Then review and modify the form values as "
"needed. Save your settings and preview the current appearance of the widget "
"by clicking the 'Save and Preview' button. Then 'Select' and copy the "
"'Widget Code' into any web page."
msgstr "Označite polje »Omogoči gradnik«, nato preglejte in po potrebi spremenite vrednosti. Nastavitve shranite in z gumbom »Shrani in prikaži predogled« preglejte videz gradnika. Nato izberite in kopirajte kodo gradnika na poljubno spletno stran."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Widget.hlp
msgid ""
"If this campaign has specific start and end dates, embedded widgets will "
"display the link to your Home Page instead of the Contribute button once the"
" campaign is over."
msgstr "Če ima kampanja določen začetni in končni datum, bodo vdelani gradniki po koncu kampanje namesto gumba Prispevaj prikazali povezavo do domače strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Widget.tpl
msgid ""
"CiviContribute widgets allow you and your supporters to easily promote this "
"fund-raising campaign. Widget code can be added to any web page.  It will "
"provide a real-time display of current contribution results and a direct "
"link to this contribution page."
msgstr "Gradniki CiviContribute vam in vašim podpornikom omogočajo preprosto promocijo kampanje za zbiranje sredstev. Kodo gradnika lahko dodate na katero koli spletno stran. Gradnik v realnem času prikazuje rezultate prispevkov in vsebuje neposredno povezavo do te strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Widget.tpl
msgid "Add this widget to any web page by copying and pasting the code below."
msgstr "Gradnik dodajte na spletno stran tako, da kopirate in prilepite spodnjo kodo."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Widget.tpl
msgid "Select Code"
msgstr "Izberi kodo"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionPage/Widget.tpl
msgid "The code for adding this widget to web pages will be displayed here."
msgstr "Tukaj bo prikazana koda za dodajanje gradnika na spletne strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "not available"
msgstr "ni na voljo"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "(ongoing)"
msgstr "(poteka)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "Interval"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Associated participants"
msgstr "Povezani udeleženci"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Processor Fee"
msgstr "Provizija ponudnika plačilnih storitev"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Net Amount"
msgstr "Neto znesek"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Received Into"
msgstr "Prejeto na"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Refund Transaction ID"
msgstr "ID transakcije vračila"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/UserDashboard.tpl
msgid "Receipt Sent"
msgstr "Račun je bil poslan"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Personal Campaign Page Contribution Information"
msgstr "Podatki o prispevku prek osebne strani kampanje"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Contribution was made through this personal campaign page."
msgstr "Prispevek je bil oddan prek te osebne strani kampanje."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "In Public Honor Roll?"
msgstr "Na javnem seznamu podpornikov?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ContributionView.tpl
msgid "Honor Roll Name"
msgstr "Ime na seznamu podpornikov"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete this premium?"
msgstr "Ali res želite izbrisati to nagrado?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"This will also remove the premium from any contribution pages that currently"
" include it."
msgstr "S tem bo nagrada odstranjena tudi z vseh strani za prispevke, ki jo vključujejo."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"Name of the premium (product, service, subscription, etc.) as it will be "
"displayed to contributors."
msgstr "Ime nagrade, izdelka, storitve ali naročnine, kot bo prikazano plačnikom."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"Optional product SKU or code. If used, this value will be included in "
"contributor receipts."
msgstr "Neobvezna šifra SKU ali koda izdelka. Če jo navedete, bo vključena v potrdila."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid "Current Image"
msgstr "Trenutna slika"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid "Default product image with the words \"No image available\"."
msgstr "Privzeta slika izdelka z besedilom »Slika ni na voljo«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"You can give this premium a picture that will be displayed on the "
"contribution page. The image displayed will be resized to a maximum of %1 "
"pixels. Images must be in GIF, JPEG, or PNG format."
msgstr "Nagradi lahko dodate sliko, ki bo prikazana na strani za prispevke. Velikost slike bo zmanjšana na največ %1 slikovnih pik. Slika mora biti v obliki GIF, JPEG ali PNG."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"The minimum contribution amount required to be eligible to select this "
"premium. If you want to offer it to all contributors regardless of "
"contribution amount, enter '0'. If display of minimum contribution amounts "
"is enabled then this text is displayed:"
msgstr "Najnižji znesek prispevka za upravičenost do izbire nagrade. Če jo želite ponuditi vsem plačnikom ne glede na znesek, vnesite »0«. Če je omogočen prikaz najnižjih zneskov, se prikaže naslednje besedilo:"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid "(Contribute at least X to be eligible for this gift.)"
msgstr "(Za upravičenost do tega darila prispevajte vsaj X.)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"The market value of this premium (e.g. retail price). For tax-deductible "
"contributions, this amount will be used to set the non-deductible amount in "
"the contribution record and receipt."
msgstr "Tržna vrednost nagrade, na primer maloprodajna cena. Pri prispevkih z davčno olajšavo se ta vrednost uporabi kot znesek brez davčne olajšave v zapisu prispevka in potrdilu."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"You may optionally record the actual cost of this premium to your "
"organization. This may be useful when evaluating net return for this "
"incentive."
msgstr "Po želji lahko zabeležite dejanski strošek nagrade za organizacijo. Podatek je uporaben pri ocenjevanju neto donosa te spodbude."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"Select a financial type that is linked to both a 'Cost of Sales Premiums "
"Account' and a 'Premiums Inventory Account' if you want to generate "
"accounting transactions to track the cost of premiums used."
msgstr "Če želite ustvarjati računovodske transakcije za spremljanje stroškov uporabljenih nagrad, izberite finančno vrsto, povezano z računoma »Stroški prodanih nagrad« in »Zaloga nagrad«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter a comma-delimited list of color, size, etc. options for the product if"
" applicable. Contributors will be presented a drop-down menu of these "
"options when they select this product."
msgstr "Po potrebi vnesite z vejicami ločen seznam možnosti izdelka, kot so barve ali velikosti. Ob izbiri izdelka bodo plačnikom prikazane v spustnem meniju."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"You can also use the format key=label, where the key could be the SKU of the"
" option, for example."
msgstr "Uporabite lahko tudi obliko ključ=oznaka, pri čemer je ključ lahko na primer SKU možnosti."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid "Subscription or Service Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve naročnine ali storitve"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"Select 'Rolling' if the subscription or service starts on the current day. "
"Select 'Fixed' if the start date is a fixed month and day within the current"
" year (set this value in the next field)."
msgstr "Izberite »Drseče«, če se naročnina ali storitev začne danes. Izberite »Fiksno«, če sta začetni mesec in dan v tekočem letu nespremenljiva; vrednost vnesite v naslednje polje."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"Month and day (MMDD) on which a fixed period subscription or service will "
"start. EXAMPLE: A fixed period subscription with Start Day set to 0101 means"
" that the subscription period would be 1/1/06 - 12/31/06 for anyone signing "
"up during 2006."
msgstr "Mesec in dan (MMDD) začetka naročnine ali storitve s fiksnim obdobjem. PRIMER: Če je začetni dan nastavljen na 0101, bi za vse, ki se naročijo leta 2006, naročnina trajala od 1. 1. 2006 do 31. 12. 2006."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid "Duration of subscription or service (e.g. 12-month subscription)."
msgstr "Trajanje naročnine ali storitve (npr. 12-mesečna naročnina)."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"Frequency of subscription or service (e.g. journal delivered every two "
"months)."
msgstr "Pogostost naročnine ali storitve (npr. revija dostavljena vsaka dva meseca)."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/PCP/Campaign.tpl
msgid ""
"Personalize the contents and appearance of your fundraising page here. You "
"will be able to return to this page and make changes at any time."
msgstr "Tukaj prilagodite vsebino in videz strani za zbiranje sredstev. Kadar koli se lahko vrnete in jo spremenite."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/PCP/Campaign.tpl
msgid ""
"Introduce the campaign and why you're supporting it. This text will appear "
"at the top of your personal page AND at the top of the main campaign "
"contribution page when people make a contribution through your page."
msgstr "Predstavite kampanjo in razloge za podporo. Besedilo bo prikazano na vrhu vaše osebne strani IN na vrhu glavne strani za prispevke kampanje, ko ljudje prispevajo prek vaše strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/PCP/Campaign.tpl
msgid "The text for the contribute button."
msgstr "Besedilo gumba za prispevanje."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/PCP/Campaign.tpl
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, an \"honor roll\" will be displayed with the "
"names (or nicknames) of the people who donated through your fundraising "
"page. (Donors will have the option to remain anonymous. Their names will NOT"
" be listed.)"
msgstr "Če je možnost označena, bo prikazan seznam podpornikov z imeni ali vzdevki ljudi, ki so prispevali prek vaše strani za zbiranje sredstev. Donatorji se lahko odločijo ostati anonimni; njihova imena NE bodo navedena."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/PaymentInfoBlock.tpl
msgid "No payments found for this %1 record"
msgstr "Za zapis %1 ni bilo mogoče najti plačil"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Search/EmptyResults.tpl
msgid "if you are searching by contributor name, check your spelling"
msgstr "če iščete po imenu plačnika, preverite črkovanje"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/SearchContribution.tpl
msgid "Find Contribution Pages"
msgstr "Najdi strani prispevkov"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Selector.tpl
msgid "(Recurring Template)"
msgstr "(predloga ponavljajočega se prispevka)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Selector.tpl
msgid "(Recurring)"
msgstr "(ponavljajoče se)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/SoftCredit.tpl
msgid "another soft credit"
msgstr "še en posredni prispevek"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/Batch.tpl
msgid ""
"Update field values for each contribution as needed. Click <strong>Update "
"Contributions</strong> below to save all your changes. To set a field to the"
" same value for ALL rows, enter that value for the first contribution and "
"then click the <strong>Copy icon</strong> (next to the column title)."
msgstr "Po potrebi posodobite vrednosti polj posameznih prispevkov. Za shranjevanje vseh sprememb spodaj kliknite <strong>Posodobi prispevke</strong>. Če želite polje nastaviti na enako vrednost v VSEH vrsticah, vrednost vnesite pri prvem prispevku in kliknite <strong>ikono Kopiraj</strong> ob naslovu stolpca."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/Delete.tpl
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete the selected contributions? This delete "
"operation cannot be undone and will delete all transactions and activity "
"associated with these contributions."
msgstr "Ali res želite izbrisati izbrane prispevke? Izbrisa ni mogoče razveljaviti, izbrisane pa bodo vse transakcije in dejavnosti, povezane s prispevki."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/Invoice.hlp
msgid ""
"You can add a message that will appear at the top of the invoice email. This"
" message will be the same for all recipients."
msgstr "Dodate lahko sporočilo, ki bo prikazano na vrhu e-pošte z računom. Sporočilo bo enako za vse prejemnike."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/Invoice.tpl
msgid ""
"You may choose to email invoice to contributors OR download a PDF file "
"containing one invoice per page to your local computer by clicking "
"<strong>Process Invoice(s)</strong> . Your browser may display the file for "
"you automatically, or you may need to open it for printing using any PDF "
"reader (such as Adobe&reg; Reader)."
msgstr "Račune lahko plačnikom pošljete po e-pošti ALI s klikom <strong>Obdelaj račune</strong> prenesete datoteko PDF z enim računom na stran. Brskalnik lahko datoteko prikaže samodejno, sicer jo za tiskanje odprite z bralnikom PDF, kot je Adobe&reg; Reader."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/PDF.tpl
msgid ""
"You may choose to email receipts to contributors OR download a PDF file "
"containing one receipt per page to your local computer by clicking "
"<strong>Process Receipt(s)</strong>. Your browser may display the file for "
"you automatically, or you may need to open it for printing using any PDF "
"reader (such as Adobe&reg; Reader)."
msgstr "Potrdila lahko plačnikom pošljete po e-pošti ALI s klikom <strong>Obdelaj potrdila</strong> prenesete datoteko PDF z enim potrdilom na stran. Brskalnik lahko datoteko prikaže samodejno, sicer jo za tiskanje odprite z bralnikom PDF, kot je Adobe&reg; Reader."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/PDFLetter.hlp
msgid ""
"You can choose to show contribution data for multiple contributions from the"
" same contact in one location in the body of your letter. This option can be"
" useful for end-of-year thank-you letters, or other situations where you "
"want to acknowledge multiple gifts."
msgstr "Podatke o več prispevkih istega stika lahko prikažete skupaj na enem mestu v besedilu pisma. Možnost je uporabna pri zahvalnih pismih ob koncu leta in drugih primerih, ko se želite zahvaliti za več prispevkov."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/PDFLetter.hlp
msgid ""
"If you use this option, you may want to use a table layout to format the "
"output from the contribution token(s). In this case select the 'Table Cell' "
"separator, and each contribution instance will be placed in it's own table "
"cell. Alternatively, you can use the simple 'Comma' separator which will "
"simply separate the contribution amounts and / or dates with commas (e.g. "
"'Thank you for your generous contributions of $150.00, $200.00, $450.00 this"
" year.')."
msgstr "Pri tej možnosti lahko za oblikovanje izpisa žetonov prispevkov uporabite tabelo. Izberite ločilo »Celica tabele« in vsak prispevek bo v svoji celici. Lahko pa uporabite preprosto ločilo »Vejica«, ki z vejicami loči zneske in/ali datume prispevkov (npr. »Hvala za vaše letošnje velikodušne prispevke v višini 150,00 $, 200,00 $ in 450,00 $.«)."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/PDFLetter.hlp
msgid ""
"You can choose to send thank-you letters as emails to contacts who are able "
"to receive email. If you choose to do this, you can also decide whether to "
"only print PDFs for the remaining contacts OR generate PDFs for all."
msgstr "Zahvalna pisma lahko pošljete po e-pošti stikom, ki jo lahko prejemajo. Izberete lahko tudi, ali naj se datoteke PDF ustvarijo samo za preostale stike ALI za vse."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/PDFLetter.tpl
msgid "Thank-you Letter for Contributions (PDF)"
msgstr "Zahvalno pismo za prispevke (PDF)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/Status.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to record received payments for \"pay later\" online "
"contributions, membership signups and event registrations. You can use the "
"Transaction ID field to record account+check number, bank transfer "
"identifier, or other unique payment identifier."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem zabeležite prejeta plačila za spletne prispevke z možnostjo »plačaj pozneje«, včlanitve in prijave na dogodke. V polje ID transakcije lahko vnesete številko računa in čeka, identifikator bančnega nakazila ali drug enolični identifikator plačila."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/Status.tpl
msgid ""
"The contribution status will be updated as appropriate.  To update "
"contribution statuses directly, return to the search results and select "
"\"Update multiple contributions\"."
msgstr "Stanje prispevka bo ustrezno posodobljeno. Če ga želite posodobiti neposredno, se vrnite na rezultate iskanja in izberite »Posodobi več prispevkov«."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task/Status.tpl
msgid ""
"When checked CiviCRM will send an e-mail receipt to the donor. Leave "
"unchecked when you don't want to send an e-mail."
msgstr "Če je možnost označena, bo CiviCRM donatorju poslal potrdilo po e-pošti. Če e-pošte ne želite poslati, je ne označite."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/Task.tpl
msgid "Number of selected contributions: %1"
msgstr "Število izbranih prispevkov: %1"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/UpdateBilling.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to update the credit card and billing name and address used "
"for this recurring contribution."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem posodobite kreditno kartico ter ime in naslov za obračunavanje tega ponavljajočega se prispevka."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/UpdateSubscription.tpl
msgid "WARNING: This recurring contribution is linked to membership:"
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Ta ponavljajoči se prispevek je povezan s članstvom:"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/UpdateSubscription.tpl
msgid ""
"To change the amount you need to edit the template contribution. Click on "
"\"View Template\" and then \"Edit\" from the list of recurring contributions"
msgstr "Če želite spremeniti znesek, morate urediti predlogo prispevka. Na seznamu ponavljajočih se prispevkov kliknite »Prikaži predlogo« in nato »Uredi«"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Form/UpdateSubscription.tpl
msgid ""
"Total number of payments to be made. Set this to 0 if this is an open-ended "
"commitment i.e. no set end date."
msgstr "Skupno število plačil. Vnesite 0, če je zaveza časovno neomejena in nima določenega končnega datuma."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.hlp
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.tpl
msgid ""
"CiviContribute allows you to create and maintain any number of Online "
"Contribution Pages. You can create different pages for different programs or"
" campaigns, and you can customize text, amounts, types of information "
"collected from contributors, etc."
msgstr "CiviContribute omogoča ustvarjanje in vzdrževanje poljubnega števila spletnih strani za prispevke. Ustvarite lahko različne strani za posamezne programe ali kampanje ter prilagodite besedila, zneske in vrste podatkov, ki jih zbirate od plačnikov."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.hlp
msgid "For existing pages"
msgstr "Za obstoječe strani"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.hlp
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Configure</strong> to view and modify settings, amounts, and "
"text for existing pages."
msgstr "Za ogled in spreminjanje nastavitev, zneskov ter besedila obstoječih strani kliknite <strong>Nastavi</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.hlp
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Test-drive</strong> to try out the page in <strong>test "
"mode</strong>. This allows you to go through the full contribution process "
"using a dummy credit card on a test server."
msgstr "Kliknite <strong>Preizkus</strong>, da stran preizkusite v <strong>preizkusnem načinu</strong>. Tako lahko na preizkusnem strežniku izvedete celoten postopek prispevanja s preizkusno kreditno kartico."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.hlp
msgid ""
"If your page is enabled, click <strong>Live Page</strong> to view to the "
"page in <strong>live mode</strong>."
msgstr "Če je stran omogočena, kliknite <strong>Dejanska stran</strong>, da jo prikažete v <strong>dejanskem načinu</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.hlp
msgid ""
"Click <a href='%1'>New Contribution Page</a> to create and configure a new "
"online contribution page using the step-by-step wizard."
msgstr "Kliknite <a href='%1'>Nova stran za prispevke</a>, da s čarovnikom po korakih ustvarite in nastavite novo spletno stran za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid "Add Contribution Page"
msgstr "Dodaj stran prispevka"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.tpl
msgid ""
"No available Contribution Pages match your search criteria. Suggestions:"
msgstr "Nobena stran za prispevke ne ustreza vašim merilom iskanja. Predlogi:"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.tpl
msgid "Or you can <a href='%1'>browse all available Contribution Pages</a>."
msgstr "Lahko tudi <a href='%1'>pregledate vse razpoložljive strani za prispevke</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionPage.tpl
msgid ""
"No contribution pages have been created yet. Click <a accesskey=\"N\" "
"href='%1'>here</a> to create a new contribution page."
msgstr "Ustvarjena ni še nobena stran za prispevke. Za ustvarjanje nove strani kliknite <a accesskey=\"N\" href='%1'>tukaj</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecur.tpl
msgid "every %1 %2"
msgstr "vsakih %1 %2"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecur.tpl
msgid "Cancel Reason"
msgstr "Prekliči razlog"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecur.tpl
msgid "Cycle Day"
msgstr "Dan cikla"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecur.tpl
msgid "Next Contribution"
msgstr "Naslednji prispevek"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecur.tpl
msgid "Auto Renew?"
msgstr "Samodejno podaljšanje?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecur.tpl
msgid "Send receipt for each contribution?"
msgstr "Pošlji potrdilo za vsak prispevek?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecurPayments.tpl
msgid "No contributions have been recorded for this recurring contribution."
msgstr "Za ta ponavljajoči se prispevek ni zabeležen noben prispevek."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecurSelector.tpl
msgid "Next Scheduled Date"
msgstr "Naslednji načrtovani datum"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionRecurSelector.tpl
msgid "End or Modified Date"
msgstr "Končni datum ali datum spremembe"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionSoft.tpl
msgid "Personal Campaign Page?"
msgstr "Osebna stran kampanje?"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionSoftTotals.tpl
msgid "# Completed Soft Credits"
msgstr "Št. zaključenih posrednih prispevkov"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionSoftTotals.tpl
msgid "Avg Soft Credit Amount"
msgstr "Povprečni znesek posrednega prispevka"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionSoftTotals.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionTotals.tpl
msgid "Cancelled/Refunded"
msgstr "Preklicano/vrnjeno"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionTotals.tpl
msgid "Current Fiscal Year-to-Date"
msgstr "Tekoče poslovno leto do danes"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionTotals.tpl
msgid "# Completed Contributions"
msgstr "Št. zaključenih prispevkov"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionTotals.tpl
msgid "Avg Amount"
msgstr "Povprečni znesek"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionTotals.tpl
msgid "# Completed"
msgstr "Št. zaključenih"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionTotals.tpl
msgid "Avg"
msgstr "Povp."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ContributionType.tpl
msgid ""
"Financial types are used to categorize contributions for reporting and "
"accounting purposes. These are also referred to as <strong>Funds</strong>. "
"You may set up as many types as needed. Each type can carry an accounting "
"code which can be used to map contributions to codes in your accounting "
"system. Commonly used financial types are: Donation, Campaign Contribution, "
"Membership Dues..."
msgstr "Finančne vrste se uporabljajo za razvrščanje prispevkov za poročanje in računovodstvo ter se imenujejo tudi <strong>skladi</strong>. Nastavite jih lahko poljubno število. Vsaki vrsti lahko dodelite računovodsko kodo za preslikavo prispevkov v kode računovodskega sistema. Pogoste finančne vrste so donacija, prispevek kampanji in članarina."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.hlp
msgid ""
"CiviContribute allows you to create customized page(s) for collecting online"
" contributions. You can also input and track offline contributions. To enter"
" contributions manually for individual contacts, use <a href='%1'>Find "
"Contacts</a> to locate the contact. Then click <strong>View</strong> to go "
"to their summary page and click on the <strong>New Contribution</strong> "
"link. You can also <a href='%2'>import batches of offline contributions</a> "
"from other sources."
msgstr "CiviContribute omogoča ustvarjanje prilagojenih strani za zbiranje spletnih prispevkov ter vnos in spremljanje nespletnih prispevkov. Za ročni vnos prispevka posameznega stika ga poiščite z možnostjo <a href='%1'>Poišči stike</a>, kliknite <strong>Prikaži</strong> in na strani s povzetkom izberite <strong>Nov prispevek</strong>. Iz drugih virov lahko tudi <a href='%2'>uvozite pakete nespletnih prispevkov</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.hlp
msgid ""
"The <strong>Contribution Summary</strong> table provides a summary of month "
"and year-to-date contribution totals, and includes shortcuts to view the "
"contribution details for these commonly used search periods. To run your own"
" customized searches - click <a href='%1'>Find Contributions</a>. You can "
"search by Contributor Name, Amount Range, and a variety of other criteria."
msgstr "Tabela <strong>Povzetek prispevkov</strong> prikazuje skupne zneske prispevkov za tekoči mesec in leto ter bližnjice do podrobnosti za ti pogosto uporabljeni obdobji. Za iskanje po meri kliknite <a href='%1'>Poišči prispevke</a>. Iščete lahko po imenu plačnika, razponu zneskov in drugih merilih."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid "(n/a)"
msgstr "(ni na voljo)"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid "Current Fiscal Year-To-Date"
msgstr "Tekoče poslovno leto do danes"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid "Contribution Summary"
msgstr "Povzetek prispevkov"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid "Chart Layout"
msgstr "Prikaz grafikona"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid "Table Layout"
msgstr "Tabelarični prikaz"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid "Recent Contributions"
msgstr "Zadnji prispevki"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"CiviContribute allows you to configure any number of "
"<strong>Premiums</strong> which can be offered to contributors as incentives"
" / thank-you gifts. Premiums may be tangible items (i.e. a coffee mug or "
"t-shirt), or they may be a membership or subscription with a pre-determined "
"duration."
msgstr "CiviContribute omogoča nastavitev poljubnega števila <strong>nagrad</strong>, ki jih lahko ponudite kot spodbudo ali zahvalno darilo. Nagrade so lahko fizični izdelki, kot sta skodelica ali majica, ali članstva oziroma naročnine z vnaprej določenim trajanjem."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this section to enter and update all premiums that you want to offer on "
"any of your Online Contribution pages. Then you can assign one or more "
"premiums to a specific Contribution page from <a href='%1'>Configure Online "
"Contribution Pages</a> <strong>&raquo; Configure &raquo; Premiums</strong>."
msgstr "V tem razdelku vnesite in posodobite nagrade, ki jih želite ponuditi na spletnih straneh za prispevke. Eno ali več nagrad nato dodelite posamezni strani v <a href='%1'>Nastavi spletne strani za prispevke</a> <strong>&raquo; Nastavi &raquo; Nagrade</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ManagePremiums.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Premium.tpl
msgid "Min Contribution"
msgstr "Najnižji prispevek"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ManagePremiums.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Premium.tpl
msgid "Actual Cost"
msgstr "Dejanski strošek"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid "Add Premium"
msgstr "Dodaj nagrado"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/ManagePremiums.tpl
msgid ""
"No premium products have been created for your site. You can <a "
"href='%1'>add one</a>."
msgstr "Za spletno mesto ni ustvarjena nobena nagrada. Lahko jo <a href='%1'>dodate</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/PcpUserDashboard.tpl
msgid "Your Page"
msgstr "Vaša stran"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/PcpUserDashboard.tpl
msgid "In Support of"
msgstr "V podporo"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/PcpUserDashboard.tpl
msgid "Campaign Ends"
msgstr "Konec kampanje"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/PcpUserDashboard.tpl
msgid "Preview your Personal Campaign Page"
msgstr "Predogled osebne strani kampanje"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/PcpUserDashboard.tpl
msgid "You do not have any active Personal Campaign pages."
msgstr "Nimate aktivnih osebnih strani kampanje."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/PcpUserDashboard.tpl
msgid "Create a Personal Campaign Page for another campaign:"
msgstr "Ustvarite osebno stran za drugo kampanjo:"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/PcpUserDashboard.tpl
msgid "Become a supporter by creating a Personal Campaign Page:"
msgstr "Postanite podpornik in ustvarite osebno stran kampanje:"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/PcpUserDashboard.tpl
msgid "View campaign page"
msgstr "Prikaži stran kampanje"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"The premiums listed below are currently offered on this Contribution Page. "
"If you have other premiums which are not already being offered on this page,"
" you will see a link below to offer another premium. Use <a "
"href='%1'>Contributions &raquo; Premiums</a> to create or enable additional "
"premium choices which can be used on any Contribution page."
msgstr "Spodnje nagrade so trenutno na voljo na tej strani za prispevke. Če imate druge nagrade, ki še niso ponujene, bo spodaj prikazana povezava za dodajanje nove. V <a href='%1'>Prispevki &raquo; Nagrade</a> ustvarite ali omogočite dodatne nagrade, ki jih lahko uporabite na kateri koli strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Premium.tpl
msgid "Offer Another Premium on this Contribution Page"
msgstr "Ponudi drugo nagrado na tej strani za prispevke"

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"There are no premiums offered on this contribution page yet. You can <a "
"href='%1'>add one</a>."
msgstr "Na tej strani še ni nagrad. Lahko jo <a href='%1'>dodate</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"There are no active premiums for your site. You can <a href='%1'>create "
"and/or enable premiums here</a>."
msgstr "Na spletnem mestu ni aktivnih nagrad. Tukaj jih lahko <a href='%1'>ustvarite in/ali omogočite</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Premium.tpl
msgid ""
"Premiums can be added after specifying Premiums Settings above and saving."
msgstr "Nagrade lahko dodate po določitvi zgornjih nastavitev in shranjevanju."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Optional identifier for the contribution source (campaign name, event, "
"mailer, etc.)."
msgstr "Neobvezni identifikator vira prispevka, kot je kampanja, dogodek ali pošiljanje."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"You are not allowed to change the total amount as it will lead to incorrect "
"line item entries. You can either delete or recreate or install <a %1>Line "
"Item Editor</a>."
msgstr "Skupnega zneska ne smete spremeniti, ker bi to povzročilo napačne postavke. Prispevek lahko izbrišete in znova ustvarite ali namestite <a %1>Urejevalnik postavk</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Tab.hlp
msgid "Select the appropriate financial type for this transaction."
msgstr "Izberite ustrezno finančno vrsto te transakcije."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Note: if the correct payment method is not listed here (e.g. for in-kind "
"donations) ask your administrator to add a new option to this list."
msgstr "Opomba: Če ustreznega načina plačila ni na seznamu, na primer pri stvarnih donacijah, prosite skrbnika, naj doda novo možnost."

#: templates/CRM/Contribute/Page/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Use to indicate that a contact has a relationship with the actual donor and "
"/ or was indirectly responsible for the contribution. For example, if one "
"family member makes a large contribution - it is often useful to record a "
"Soft Credit for the other family member(s). You can record a soft credit "
"while adding or editing a contribution record from this tab."
